3:Tbcc,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Does clicking on your links cost me anything?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Clicking on our affiliate links or signing up for a product through them will never cost you any extra money. In fact, some of our partnerships allow us to offer exclusive bonuses or better rates for our readers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you only review products that pay you a commission?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely not. Our editorial team reviews and ranks products based on their merit and value to our readers. Many of the products we recommend do not have affiliate programs. If a product is the best in its category, we will tell you, regardless of whether we make money from it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you handle sponsored content?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"SmartMoneyPath does not currently publish sponsored content or 'native advertising' that looks like editorial. If we ever decide to work with a partner on a specific article, it will be clearly and prominently labeled as 'Sponsored' at the very top of the page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Google AdSense influence your content?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Google AdSense serves ads based on automated algorithms. Our editorial team has no control over which specific ads appear on a page, and those ads have no impact on the educational content or reviews we produce."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you avoid conflicts of interest?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We maintain a strict 'firewall' between our editorial and business teams. Our writers and researchers are not privy to affiliate payout data, ensuring their recommendations are based solely on objective product analysis."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where does the money go?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The revenue generated supports the operation of this site, including paying our expert writers, funding deep-dive research projects, maintaining our server infrastructure, and ensuring our tools and calculators remain accurate and free for everyone."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What if I have a problem with a product you recommended?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"While we strive for accuracy, we do not own or operate any of the financial products we review. If you have an issue with a specific bank or service, you should contact their customer support directly. However, we value your feedback—if you feel a product we recommend has changed for the worse, please let us know."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use your site without clicking affiliate links?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. All our guides, calculations, and research are available for free. You are under no obligation to use our links to sign up for products. You can always visit a provider's website directly by typing their URL into your browser."}}]}0:["q5sojit3c5RDsE2igI56D",[[["",{"children":["how-we-make-money",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["how-we-make-money",{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-white","children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.yourdomain.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"How We Make Money\",\"item\":\"https://www.yourdomain.com/how-we-make-money\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"name\":\"How We Make Money\",\"description\":\"Disclosure of the revenue models used by SmartMoneyPath to provide free financial education.\",\"url\":\"https://www.yourdomain.com/how-we-make-money\",\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"SmartMoneyPath\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.yourdomain.com/og-image.svg\"}}}"}}],["$","section",null,{"className":"bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-50 to-secondary-50 pt-32 pb-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center","children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-6","children":"How We Make Money"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xl text-secondary-600 leading-relaxed","children":"To keep our library of financial guides and calculators free for everyone, we use a transparent revenue model. Here is exactly how we fund SmartMoneyPath."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 text-sm text-secondary-500","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-shield-check h-4 w-4 text-primary-600","children":[["$","path","oel41y",{"d":"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"}],["$","path","dzmm74",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4"}],"$undefined"]}]," Transparent"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-shield-check h-4 w-4 text-primary-600",